    <section class="fg-actuator-guide__outdoor" aria-labelledby="outdoor-linear-actuators">
      <h2 id="outdoor-linear-actuators">Outdoor Linear Actuators</h2>
      <p>Choosing an outdoor linear actuator? Start with the exposure it will face. Our flagship <a href="/products/super-duty-actuators">Super Duty</a> and <a href="/products/heavy-duty-linear-actuator-ip66">IP66 Heavy Duty Rod</a> are dust and water resistant. Check the operating temperature for your installation and protect the wiring connections from moisture. IP66 does not cover submersion.</p>
